# P1 second pass (G1.8, 2026-10-23): friction experiments, measured and rejected (ADR-0024,
# "Second pass"). Against 90258e4. Env switches: NOLBFGS (pure Newton for rigid groups), REVERSE
# (sliding contacts turned back through their anchors stiffened, `contact/reversal.rs`), LAMX (lambda
# extrapolated from the last two states), SELREF (refresh only for sliding or near-cone contacts),
